            { kind = "para", text = "With |cffa8d8ffCOMP|r, |cffa8d8ffCOMBAT:COMP:ROGUE=NO|r needs a rogue on the enemy team. To mean \"no rogue in combat, including no rogue at all\", write |cffa8d8ffNOT COMBAT:COMP:ROGUE=YES|r." },
